<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00669">
	<title>Camera Settings</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04054">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e04055">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_C00_006_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<ol outputclass="callout" id="e04056">
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Camera Settings</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Display Contents</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p><uicontrol>Display Settings</uicontrol></p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>While the vehicle is <term translate="no">ON</term>, tap the setup icon (<image href="images/WKIA_152.jpg" scale="15" align="left" placement="inline"/>) or tap <menucascade><uicontrol>Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver Assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>Parking Safety</uicontrol><uicontrol>Camera Settings</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system screen to change the Rear View Monitor settings.</p>
		<p><uicontrol>Display Contents</uicontrol>: Choose which information displays on the parking assistance screen.</p>
	</conbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00667.dita#t00667" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Surround View Monitor settings</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</concept>